WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.920
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.190 --> 01:43.900
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.200 --> 01:46.750
[Episode 1]

4
02:32.310 --> 02:33.710
Being pushed to the brink

5
02:34.680 --> 02:36.280
often happens in an instant.

6
02:38.910 --> 02:40.079
I misstepped

7
02:40.680 --> 02:42.910
and got trapped in the rubble.

8
02:44.400 --> 02:46.520
It feels just like last winter.

9
02:48.079 --> 02:49.280
I was

10
02:50.079 --> 02:51.150
caught in a dilemma

11
02:53.079 --> 02:54.000
I even tried

12
02:54.680 --> 02:56.030
to figure out

13
02:56.150 --> 02:58.350
when the gears of fate started turning.

14
03:01.240 --> 03:02.500
Was it that phone call?

15
03:04.400 --> 03:05.120
No.

16
03:05.870 --> 03:07.400
It must have been that snow.

17
03:09.630 --> 03:11.870
I thought going so far south,

18
03:12.030 --> 03:13.280
I'd be safe.

19
03:15.240 --> 03:16.710
But I never expected

20
03:18.000 --> 03:19.470
it would snow there, too.

21
03:18.150 --> 03:21.270
[One year ago, Shenzhen]

22
03:22.750 --> 03:23.560
Hello.

23
03:24.520 --> 03:26.180
Can the surgery be postponed?

24
03:26.310 --> 03:27.120
Dr. Liu,

25
03:27.710 --> 03:29.079
what's going on with you?

26
03:29.079 --> 03:31.140
Are you not satisfied with the price?

27
03:31.240 --> 03:31.960
You know

28
03:31.960 --> 03:32.470
the surgeons here

29
03:32.470 --> 03:34.150
can't perform this surgery.

30
03:35.520 --> 03:36.840
If you don't come now,

31
03:37.310 --> 03:38.910
this patient will die.

32
03:59.190 --> 04:00.150
What do you mean surgery

33
04:00.150 --> 04:01.520
inherently carries risks?

34
04:01.520 --> 04:02.240
I'm telling you.

35
04:02.240 --> 04:03.800
You killed my daughter!

36
04:03.960 --> 04:04.910
Give my granddaughter back to me!

37
04:04.910 --> 04:06.430
Give my granddaughter back to me!

38
04:06.430 --> 04:08.960
I want you to pay with your money and your life!

39
04:10.680 --> 04:11.800
The family demanded

40
04:11.800 --> 04:13.190
750,000 in compensation

41
04:13.190 --> 04:14.280
from the hospital.

42
04:14.150 --> 04:15.260
[Shenzhen Shenya Hospital]

43
04:14.520 --> 04:16.310
Since you performed an unauthorized surgery

44
04:15.290 --> 04:19.149
[“Top 10 Young Physicians” Award Certificate—Liu Zhengliang]

45
04:16.310 --> 04:17.430
in another location,

46
04:17.430 --> 04:19.000
and it violated hospital regulations,

47
04:19.000 --> 04:20.279
the insurance company

48
04:20.279 --> 04:21.610
won't pay a single cent.

49
04:22.160 --> 04:24.120
We will now announce the medical association's

50
04:24.120 --> 04:26.240
findings on whether

51
04:26.390 --> 04:28.650
Beijiang New District General Hospital

52
04:29.040 --> 04:30.310
committed medical malpractice

53
04:30.310 --> 04:31.710
in its treatment of Li Ya.

54
04:35.240 --> 04:36.430
For the reputation of the hospital,

55
04:36.430 --> 04:38.510
we have to make this decision.

56
04:59.920 --> 05:01.070
Stop drinking ice water all the time.

57
05:01.070 --> 05:02.190
It's bad for your stomach.

58
05:02.190 --> 05:03.920
It's for you. It'll help purify the air.

59
05:03.920 --> 05:04.630
Thanks.

60
05:04.750 --> 05:05.680
You like playing games.

61
05:05.680 --> 05:06.510
This is for you.

62
05:06.510 --> 05:08.070
Hope you beat my record in three years.

63
05:08.070 --> 05:08.750
Thanks.

64
05:10.120 --> 05:10.920
You're always leaving your pens everywhere.

65
05:10.920 --> 05:11.830
Take this pen holder.

66
05:11.830 --> 05:12.560
It's useful.

67
05:12.950 --> 05:13.950
Just peel off the sticker.

68
05:13.950 --> 05:15.680
Okay, you're too kind.

69
05:16.680 --> 05:18.750
Stop playing on your phone all the time.

70
05:18.750 --> 05:20.350
Books are man's best friend.

71
05:20.430 --> 05:21.310
A good book for you.

72
05:21.310 --> 05:22.040
It's useful.

73
05:22.510 --> 05:23.510
Okay, thanks.

74
05:25.390 --> 05:26.360
Everyone, well,

75
05:27.390 --> 05:28.790
thanks for your hard work

76
05:29.390 --> 05:30.590
over all these years.

77
05:33.430 --> 05:34.750
He got cocky about his skills

78
05:34.750 --> 05:37.010
and started doing surgeries on the side.

79
05:37.870 --> 05:39.270
This is what happens when you don't fit in.

80
05:39.270 --> 05:40.720
He only knows skills but not how to behave.

81
05:40.720 --> 05:41.920
No one is willing to stick their neck out for him.

82
05:41.920 --> 05:43.950
to celebrate his leaving. My treat.

83
05:45.390 --> 05:46.310
Great!

84
06:11.920 --> 06:13.580
Why did you ask me to come here?

85
06:15.270 --> 06:16.200
I'm out of money.

86
06:18.360 --> 06:19.620
What's wrong with you?

87
06:21.070 --> 06:23.120
I did a freelance surgery, and it failed.

88
06:23.120 --> 06:23.800
All my money

89
06:23.800 --> 06:25.390
went to compensate the patient's family.

90
06:25.390 --> 06:26.990
What's that got to do with me?

91
06:27.160 --> 06:28.480
We broke up a year ago.

92
06:28.800 --> 06:29.800
But this car

93
06:29.870 --> 06:31.120
was bought together

94
06:31.120 --> 06:32.580
when we were still dating.

95
06:33.560 --> 06:34.490
What do you mean?

96
06:36.120 --> 06:38.240
I still have to be responsible for this car?

97
06:38.240 --> 06:38.830
No.

98
06:40.800 --> 06:41.560
Well,

99
06:42.120 --> 06:42.830
you were the one

100
06:42.830 --> 06:43.950
who insisted on buying this car back then.

101
06:43.950 --> 06:45.190
But now I really need the money,

102
06:45.190 --> 06:46.120
so I want to sell it.

103
06:46.120 --> 06:46.870
Selling it on

104
06:47.630 --> 06:48.960
a second-hand platform

105
06:49.240 --> 06:49.870
is too slow.

106
06:49.870 --> 06:51.000
I really can't wait.

107
06:51.000 --> 06:51.800
I just wanted to know:

108
06:51.800 --> 06:53.120
if I could give you a big discount,

109
06:53.120 --> 06:54.070
would you buy it?

110
07:01.750 --> 07:04.150
I don't think you can sell this car anymore.

111
07:04.510 --> 07:05.390
Why?

112
07:23.430 --> 07:25.120
Oh my God.

113
07:26.870 --> 07:28.200
How did you park the car?

114
07:30.560 --> 07:32.040
I have a whole family to feed.

115
07:32.040 --> 07:33.510
I finally found a job.

116
07:34.430 --> 07:36.560
Do you even know what kind of car this is?

117
07:36.560 --> 07:37.720
This is a Rolls-Royce.

118
07:37.720 --> 07:38.480
A Rolls-Royce.

119
07:38.480 --> 07:40.510
You couldn't afford it even if you sold me.

120
07:40.510 --> 07:41.310
Man, man, man.

121
07:41.870 --> 07:44.800
I'll give you this car as compensation. Is that okay?

122
07:45.000 --> 07:45.600
Hello,

123
07:45.720 --> 07:48.360
the number you have dialed cannot be reached at this time.

124
07:48.360 --> 07:49.800
Please try again later.

125
07:50.120 --> 07:53.159
The number you have dialed cannot be reached at this time.

126
07:53.159 --> 07:54.600
Please try again later.

127
07:54.630 --> 07:55.240
Hello,

128
07:55.360 --> 07:58.000
the number you have dialed cannot be reached at this time.

129
07:58.000 --> 07:58.750
Please...

130
08:40.150 --> 08:40.669
Hello.

131
08:42.240 --> 08:43.100
Are you at home?

132
08:44.150 --> 08:44.600
Yes.

133
08:46.150 --> 08:47.440
Let Mom answer the phone.

134
08:47.440 --> 08:48.080
I called her.

135
08:48.080 --> 08:49.210
But her phone is off.

136
08:53.240 --> 08:54.840
Hello, can you hear me?

137
08:59.870 --> 09:00.390
Liu Zhengguang,

138
09:00.390 --> 09:01.720
do you have a bad signal?

139
09:04.960 --> 09:06.510
Liu Zhengguang, can you hear me?

140
09:06.510 --> 09:07.200
Say something if you can.

141
09:07.200 --> 09:08.130
Liu Zhengliang.

142
09:09.440 --> 09:10.480
Mom is missing.

143
09:25.870 --> 09:27.670
Here is the weather forecast

144
09:27.670 --> 09:29.320
issued by the Fucheng Meteorological Observatory.

145
09:29.320 --> 09:31.870
A strong cold front from Siberia

146
09:31.910 --> 09:34.240
is expected to bring significant snowfall

147
09:34.240 --> 09:37.120
to Fucheng from Friday night into Saturday.

148
09:37.200 --> 09:38.630
The snowfall will be heavy,

149
09:38.630 --> 09:39.840
with blizzards in some areas.

150
09:39.840 --> 09:41.390
The minimum temperature will drop

151
09:41.390 --> 09:43.000
to minus 15 degrees Celsius.

152
09:43.120 --> 09:44.550
The meteorological observatory also issued

153
09:44.550 --> 09:45.080
a yellow warning for icy roads.

154
09:45.080 --> 09:47.740
-Please dress warmly -This is my first time back

155
09:47.750 --> 09:50.480
-and avoid unnecessary trips outdoors. -in Fucheng in winter in 23 years.

156
09:50.480 --> 09:52.480
Drivers, please control your speed

157
09:52.480 --> 09:54.030
and keep a safe distance.

158
09:54.420 --> 09:57.720
[Fucheng Funeral Services Street]

159
09:58.050 --> 10:03.710
[Xiao'an Paper Offerings Shop]

160
10:03.780 --> 10:10.720
[Fucheng Huaide Funeral Center]

161
10:10.770 --> 10:13.380
[Complete Funeral Services]

162
10:12.080 --> 10:16.760
Oh, my mother.

163
10:25.150 --> 10:31.750
My mother who can't come back.

164
10:32.390 --> 10:39.640
My beloved mother,

165
10:39.750 --> 10:45.150
the dear mother who can't come back.

166
10:45.840 --> 10:48.240
Mom.

167
10:50.240 --> 10:51.600
That's pretty much how it'll be, bro.

168
10:51.600 --> 10:52.120
There will be

169
10:52.120 --> 10:54.120
microphones and a band at that time.

170
10:54.440 --> 10:56.390
The atmosphere will be quite sorrowful.

171
10:56.390 --> 10:57.320
That's great.

172
10:57.870 --> 10:59.130
Give me another piece.

173
10:59.790 --> 11:01.320
This piece, “Ten Kneels to Repay a Mother's Love,” from the 1st

174
11:01.320 --> 11:03.360
-Bro. -to the 10th kneel, plus the spoken part, is...

175
11:03.360 --> 11:03.960
Bro.

176
11:04.510 --> 11:05.600
That's enough.

177
11:05.600 --> 11:07.030
How many times has she acted this out for you?

178
11:07.030 --> 11:08.960
Are you going to buy this urn or not?

179
11:09.030 --> 11:10.080
What are you doing?

180
11:10.080 --> 11:11.010
What do you mean?

181
11:11.270 --> 11:12.930
I never said I wouldn't buy it.

182
11:13.030 --> 11:14.560
What's with your attitude?

183
11:14.600 --> 11:16.480
It's not your own mother who's dead, is it?

184
11:16.480 --> 11:17.270
What are you saying?

185
11:17.270 --> 11:17.720
What?

186
11:17.720 --> 11:18.270
What are you saying?

187
11:18.270 --> 11:18.840
What did I say?

188
11:18.840 --> 11:19.550
Can't you speak properly?

189
11:19.550 --> 11:20.440
-How am I not speaking properly? -Can't you speak properly?

190
11:20.440 --> 11:21.480
-Calm down. -What's wrong with me asking?

191
11:21.480 --> 11:21.840
No, no.

192
11:21.840 --> 11:22.870
Am I not allowed to speak here?

193
11:22.870 --> 11:24.270
Please calm down. He's in a bad mood lately.

194
11:24.270 --> 11:24.790
Please bear with him.

195
11:24.790 --> 11:25.920
Who's in a good mood?

196
11:26.360 --> 11:27.870
Who can be in a good mood coming to a place like this?

197
11:27.870 --> 11:28.600
I understand you.

198
11:28.600 --> 11:29.630
I completely understand you.

199
11:29.630 --> 11:30.200
Bro,

200
11:30.390 --> 11:31.150
how about this?

201
11:31.150 --> 11:31.870
When the time comes,

202
11:31.870 --> 11:34.440
I'll throw in another half hour for free.

203
11:34.550 --> 11:36.120
You can see I'm being sincere, right?

204
11:36.120 --> 11:36.910
Is that okay?

205
11:37.120 --> 11:37.630
Look,

206
11:37.630 --> 11:39.240
it's only natural for him to be particular about the music.

207
11:39.240 --> 11:40.120
He's filial,

208
11:40.200 --> 11:40.870
isn't he?

209
11:40.870 --> 11:42.000
Are you letting people spend money here or not?

210
11:42.000 --> 11:42.600
Yes.

211
11:42.600 --> 11:43.510
Don't worry, bro.

212
11:43.510 --> 11:44.270
Wait for me a moment,

213
11:44.270 --> 11:44.910
okay?

214
11:44.910 --> 11:46.360
God is watching.

215
11:46.720 --> 11:47.630
-I don't cut corners. -I'm only doing this for you.

216
11:47.630 --> 11:48.560
I'm telling you.

217
11:48.720 --> 11:50.150
Come on, Zhengguang.

218
11:50.720 --> 11:51.850
Hurry up, come here.

219
11:53.750 --> 11:54.880
What were you doing?

220
11:56.360 --> 11:57.600
Is all the information on them

221
11:57.600 --> 11:58.630
checked?

222
11:59.270 --> 11:59.750
It's all correct.

223
11:59.750 --> 12:00.270
You go quickly.

224
12:00.270 --> 12:01.150
I'll take care of the shop.

225
12:01.150 --> 12:01.390
Okay.

226
12:01.390 --> 12:02.510
And the corn

227
12:02.750 --> 12:04.120
is ready. Do you want one?

228
12:04.120 --> 12:05.120
I won't eat, sis.

229
12:05.750 --> 12:06.720
Zip up your jacket.

230
12:06.720 --> 12:07.780
It's cold outside.

231
12:11.380 --> 12:17.300
[Deyun New Life Technology Center]

232
12:18.080 --> 12:21.550
[Winter Clearance! Must Go! Grab a Bargain!]

233
12:21.650 --> 12:27.260
[Missing Person]

234
12:22.280 --> 12:24.620
♪ I keep my mouth shut, but inside I'm wound up tight ♪

235
12:24.950 --> 12:27.630
♪ I act like nothing's wrong, but it hurts again at night ♪

236
12:27.360 --> 12:36.740
[A Tearful Plea for Justice]

237
12:28.140 --> 12:30.730
♪ This town is so big, yet I dive right in ♪

238
12:31.020 --> 12:33.550
♪ Let them laugh all they want, I've got to find her ♪

239
12:33.930 --> 12:36.500
♪ Enough with the "that's enough" crap ♪

240
12:37.030 --> 12:39.670
♪ You keep running your mouth, and I'm boiling inside ♪

241
12:40.070 --> 12:42.460
♪ Say what you want about me. I'll take it ♪

242
12:42.830 --> 12:45.220
♪ But drag my mom into this, and you'll regret it ♪

243
12:45.850 --> 12:48.230
♪ I'm no tough guy, and I'm no hero ♪

244
12:48.590 --> 12:50.770
♪ I usually let things slide and meet you halfway ♪

245
12:50.720 --> 12:52.000
Usually at this time,

246
12:51.840 --> 12:54.250
♪ But I won't back down this time ♪

247
12:52.000 --> 12:53.200
she would have finished posting and left.

248
12:53.200 --> 12:54.630
Why is she still posting them today?

249
12:54.540 --> 12:57.430
♪ I have to bring my mom home. Everything else can wait ♪

250
12:55.440 --> 12:56.960
Because she loves doing it.

251
12:56.960 --> 12:58.750
Don't you have to work overtime at your job, too?

252
12:57.850 --> 13:00.190
♪ Grab me by the collar. I still won't back down ♪

253
12:58.960 --> 13:00.320
Is that the same?

254
13:00.510 --> 13:03.210
♪ I've held it all in. Don't think you can walk away ♪

255
13:01.360 --> 13:02.480
What your mom is doing

256
13:02.480 --> 13:04.030
is affecting the appearance of the neighborhood.

257
13:03.850 --> 13:06.030
♪ Nobody act tough. Nobody start a fight ♪

258
13:04.240 --> 13:04.840
Don't...

259
13:04.840 --> 13:05.670
don't exaggerate.

260
13:05.670 --> 13:06.480
What are you doing?

261
13:06.370 --> 13:09.020
♪ Even if I get nowhere, I'll still fight you ♪

262
13:07.150 --> 13:07.960
I mean,

263
13:07.960 --> 13:09.960
if she works overtime, I'll work overtime, too.

264
13:09.960 --> 13:10.960
I'll scrape all the posters

265
13:10.960 --> 13:12.150
off these streets for you.

266
13:12.150 --> 13:14.360
I'll clear everything, whether I was supposed to or not.

267
13:14.360 --> 13:16.670
That way, it won't interfere with your work.

268
13:16.670 --> 13:18.000
Just ignore her for now.

269
13:19.510 --> 13:21.440
Okay. It's not easy for you either.

270
13:21.540 --> 13:23.830
♪ I used to think she nagged me way too much ♪

271
13:22.080 --> 13:22.960
Thank you, bro.

272
13:24.130 --> 13:26.720
♪ Now it's quiet without her, and it just feels wrong ♪

273
13:27.200 --> 13:29.840
♪ So many things I meant to say, always thinking there was time ♪

274
13:30.090 --> 13:32.760
♪ Now when my phone rings, I'm the first to jump ♪

275
13:33.240 --> 13:35.750
♪ She'd ask if I was tired. I'd say, "So what?" ♪

276
13:36.160 --> 13:38.770
♪ She'd tell me to rest. I'd sit, then get right back up ♪

277
13:39.350 --> 13:41.610
♪ I may look upset. So what? ♪

278
13:42.290 --> 13:44.680
♪ As long as there's no news, I'll keep pressing you ♪

279
13:42.620 --> 13:45.730
[A Tearful Plea for Justice]

280
13:45.010 --> 13:47.470
♪ I'm no tough guy, and I'm no hero ♪

281
13:45.740 --> 13:46.490
[Li Changlu, former head of Fucheng Paper Mill, is a heartless scumbag.]

282
13:46.510 --> 13:47.270
[He sold the mill for a song and pocketed state assets. Shame on him!]

283
13:47.300 --> 13:48.260
He put over 100 workers out of a job.

284
13:47.770 --> 13:50.030
♪ I usually let things slide and meet you halfway ♪

285
13:48.280 --> 13:49.100
[25 years of fighting for justice, and still no resolution]

286
13:49.130 --> 13:50.010
[Meanwhile, Li Changlu fled with the money]

287
13:51.050 --> 13:53.420
♪ But I won't back down this time ♪

288
13:53.840 --> 13:56.670
♪ I have to bring my mom home. Everything else can wait ♪

289
14:02.440 --> 14:03.770
Who told you to clear it?

290
14:04.270 --> 14:05.930
The neighborhood committee.

291
14:07.870 --> 14:09.080
I don't care who told you to do this.

292
14:09.080 --> 14:11.410
You can't clear it. It's delaying things.

293
14:19.440 --> 14:19.790
Buddy,

294
14:19.790 --> 14:21.240
can't you understand what I'm saying?

295
14:21.060 --> 14:26.350
[Apartments for Rent]

296
14:21.240 --> 14:22.960
Why don't you look at what I posted?

297
14:22.960 --> 14:23.840
It's a missing person notice.

298
14:23.840 --> 14:24.910
My mom is missing.

299
14:25.150 --> 14:25.670
If you take them down,

300
14:25.670 --> 14:27.400
how am I supposed to find my mom?

301
14:28.080 --> 14:28.870
Psycho.

302
14:28.960 --> 14:30.150
Why are you yelling at me?

303
14:30.150 --> 14:32.210
Your mom is missing. But my mom isn't.

304
14:37.030 --> 14:38.430
Can you watch your mouth?

305
14:38.440 --> 14:39.200
Can you watch your mouth?

306
14:39.200 --> 14:40.200
You want to fight?

307
14:41.200 --> 14:42.270
Watch your mouth.

308
14:43.080 --> 14:44.080
What?

309
14:45.480 --> 14:45.910
What?

310
14:45.910 --> 14:46.390
Let go.

311
14:47.390 --> 14:48.320
You want to fight?

312
14:48.320 --> 14:49.390
Can you talk nicely?

313
14:49.390 --> 14:50.510
Talk nicely.

314
14:50.840 --> 14:52.200
What do you mean, watch my mouth?

315
14:52.200 --> 14:54.000
What do you mean, watch my mouth?

316
14:54.670 --> 14:56.000
You wanted to hit me?

317
14:56.270 --> 14:57.270
Watch your mouth!

318
14:57.320 --> 14:58.240
My leg. My leg.

319
14:59.750 --> 15:02.970
[Missing Person]

320
15:06.200 --> 15:07.750
Come on. Exiting passengers go this way.

321
15:07.750 --> 15:08.870
Go inside. Go inside.

322
15:08.870 --> 15:09.910
Go inside.

323
15:10.790 --> 15:12.850
Turn left at the intersection ahead.

324
15:15.360 --> 15:17.620
Come on. Exiting passengers go this way.

325
15:19.200 --> 15:21.460
Come on. Exiting passengers go this way.

326
15:24.120 --> 15:26.180
Turn left at the intersection ahead.

327
15:27.440 --> 15:29.240
Exiting passengers go this way.

328
15:45.030 --> 15:46.830
Exiting passengers go this way.

329
15:47.000 --> 15:48.320
Why are you picking me up?

330
15:48.320 --> 15:49.520
Where's Zhengguang?

331
15:49.840 --> 15:51.000
He got into a fight

332
15:51.670 --> 15:52.440
and broke a bone.

333
15:52.440 --> 15:53.910
It's not a full fracture. It's a hairline fracture.

334
15:53.910 --> 15:55.440
He's lying in the hospital.

335
15:55.960 --> 15:57.440
Well, well, Liu Zhengguang...

336
15:57.440 --> 15:58.270
What's in here?

337
15:58.270 --> 15:59.360
Why is it so heavy?

338
15:59.510 --> 16:00.080
Books.

339
16:01.790 --> 16:02.960
How childish.

340
16:03.120 --> 16:03.790
Get in.

341
16:04.600 --> 16:06.800
Now you're home. What do you want to eat?

342
16:15.120 --> 16:16.150
My mom is missing.

343
16:16.440 --> 16:17.770
What exactly happened?

344
16:18.630 --> 16:19.910
I just found out, too.

345
16:21.960 --> 16:25.200
Auntie Ling was diagnosed with uterine cancer six months ago.

346
16:25.200 --> 16:26.030
When they found out,

347
16:25.310 --> 16:27.540
[Zhanqian Avenue] [Zhanqian East Station]

348
16:26.030 --> 16:27.690
it had already metastasized.

349
16:29.120 --> 16:31.030
She didn't want to undergo chemotherapy or radiation therapy.

350
16:31.030 --> 16:33.560
Zhengguang tried to persuade her many times.

351
16:36.630 --> 16:38.240
Five days before she left,

352
16:39.870 --> 16:40.750
she left a letter

353
16:40.750 --> 16:41.950
for you two brothers.

354
16:42.120 --> 16:43.320
We have a lead

355
16:43.320 --> 16:44.380
that she was asking

356
16:44.600 --> 16:46.910
about an ice hole before she disappeared.

357
16:46.910 --> 16:48.570
But nothing is confirmed yet.

358
16:53.180 --> 16:58.360
[Stop]

359
16:54.080 --> 16:56.120
Didn't you usually only stay a few days

360
16:56.120 --> 16:57.440
when you came for the Dragon Boat Festival?

361
16:57.440 --> 16:59.440
Why bring so much luggage this time?

362
17:00.670 --> 17:02.150
That's all my belongings.

363
17:04.030 --> 17:05.240
I got fired.

364
17:07.839 --> 17:08.700
What happened?

365
17:15.550 --> 17:17.680
I took a freelance surgery job before.

366
17:21.069 --> 17:22.270
And the patient died.

367
17:23.640 --> 17:26.869
[Stop]

368
17:27.109 --> 17:28.030
What happened?

369
17:32.480 --> 17:33.750
It snowed that day.

370
17:41.750 --> 17:43.110
I thought I could do it.

371
17:54.280 --> 17:57.400
[Outpatient]

372
17:57.480 --> 17:58.680
Apply pressure for three to five minutes.

373
17:57.530 --> 17:59.780
[Surgery]

374
17:59.780 --> 18:01.780
[Internal Medicine]

375
18:03.310 --> 18:05.240
We need to contact the fire department about your mom.

376
18:05.240 --> 18:06.440
I have a classmate in the fire department.

377
18:06.440 --> 18:07.970
I'll call and ask him later.

378
18:08.510 --> 18:09.270
Okay.

379
18:09.790 --> 18:10.790
That's great.

380
18:11.160 --> 18:12.070
Thank you, bro.

381
18:13.160 --> 18:15.440
I was too impulsive just now.

382
18:15.750 --> 18:16.550
It's not your fault.

383
18:16.550 --> 18:17.510
No, it's my fault.

384
18:17.510 --> 18:19.110
I've had this problem since I was a kid.

385
18:19.110 --> 18:20.770
I can't help running my mouth.

386
18:21.310 --> 18:22.160
Me too.

387
18:22.790 --> 18:23.550
What's your name?

388
18:23.550 --> 18:26.160
Jia Xin. The “Xin” with three "Jin" characters.

389
18:26.160 --> 18:26.720
And you?

390
18:26.720 --> 18:27.720
Liu Zhengguang.

391
18:28.030 --> 18:29.590
Zheng as in iron-boned.

392
18:29.590 --> 18:30.590
But are your bones made of glass or something?

393
18:30.590 --> 18:32.450
One tackle and you got a fracture.

394
18:36.400 --> 18:37.680
Look at my mouth.

395
18:37.680 --> 18:39.160
I just can't control it.

396
18:39.160 --> 18:39.920
It's fine.

397
18:41.200 --> 18:42.350
You're straightforward.

398
18:42.350 --> 18:43.920
Bro, you're straightforward.

399
18:43.920 --> 18:44.920
You're a good guy.

400
18:45.240 --> 18:46.070
What do you do?

401
18:47.590 --> 18:48.960
I don't have a fixed job.

402
18:48.960 --> 18:49.890
I do everything.

403
18:50.160 --> 18:51.160
My last job

404
18:51.160 --> 18:53.350
was tending the boiler at a hot spring hotel.

405
18:53.350 --> 18:54.960
I got the boiler running too hot.

406
18:54.960 --> 18:56.160
And people noticed.

407
18:56.680 --> 18:57.790
Then they reported it.

408
18:57.790 --> 18:58.750
And the place closed down.

409
18:58.750 --> 19:00.310
People didn't just notice it.

410
19:00.310 --> 19:01.680
They must've felt how hot it was.

411
19:01.680 --> 19:03.000
Actually, they got burned

412
19:03.000 --> 19:04.130
while soaking in it.

413
19:06.790 --> 19:07.590
What do you do?

414
19:08.070 --> 19:09.160
My job...

415
19:10.000 --> 19:11.060
How should I put it?

416
19:11.200 --> 19:13.680
I have life-and-death friends all over the world.

417
19:13.680 --> 19:16.310
Yet I can't find anyone in my own city to grab a bite or hang out with.

418
19:16.310 --> 19:17.030
What?

419
19:17.750 --> 19:18.640
You're working at a crematorium?

420
19:18.640 --> 19:19.640
Pretty much the same.

421
19:19.640 --> 19:21.110
I sell urns.

422
19:24.350 --> 19:26.110
-Nice to meet you. -Nice to meet you.

423
19:26.110 --> 19:27.400
I'll come to you next time I need one.

424
19:27.400 --> 19:27.960
Dr. Chen.

425
19:28.030 --> 19:29.030
Are you back?

426
19:29.160 --> 19:29.920
I'm back.

427
19:29.920 --> 19:31.180
Wei is looking for you.

428
19:31.200 --> 19:32.240
They said a patient just came in

429
19:32.240 --> 19:33.310
with a pistachio stuck in his airway.

430
19:33.310 --> 19:34.440
I'll be right there.

431
19:36.510 --> 19:37.440
You take my car back.

432
19:37.440 --> 19:38.830
I've already paid the medical bills.

433
19:38.830 --> 19:39.590
You're family.

434
19:39.590 --> 19:40.750
Talk nicely.

435
19:41.830 --> 19:42.890
Observation bed 5.

436
19:44.280 --> 19:47.140
[Internal Medicine]

437
19:47.680 --> 19:48.880
I'm eating out.

438
19:48.960 --> 19:51.600
[Don't make noise]

439
20:01.200 --> 20:02.400
Why didn't you tell me

440
20:02.640 --> 20:03.640
Mom was sick?

441
20:04.880 --> 20:06.480
Mom has terminal uterine cancer.

442
20:06.480 --> 20:07.680
Could you cure her if I told you?

443
20:07.680 --> 20:08.240
Were you not even

444
20:08.240 --> 20:09.510
going to tell me

445
20:09.640 --> 20:10.830
she was missing

446
20:10.880 --> 20:11.590
if I hadn't called back?

447
20:11.590 --> 20:13.030
What's the point of telling you?

448
20:13.030 --> 20:15.030
How many days a year do you come back?

449
20:28.960 --> 20:29.750
Move over.

450
20:38.510 --> 20:40.040
Have they found Mom's body?

451
20:40.830 --> 20:41.680
What body?

452
20:43.720 --> 20:45.000
Who said Mom is dead?

453
20:45.640 --> 20:46.920
Watch your mouth.

454
20:47.160 --> 20:48.200
It's obvious

455
20:48.350 --> 20:50.210
that Mom jumped into the ice hole.

456
20:50.440 --> 20:51.840
The river's frozen over.

457
20:52.000 --> 20:53.660
We can only wait until spring.

458
20:54.400 --> 20:55.200
Who said that?

459
20:56.510 --> 20:58.750
Who saw Mom jump into an ice hole?

460
20:59.590 --> 21:00.510
Did anyone see it?

461
21:00.510 --> 21:02.510
If no one saw it, she's just missing!

462
21:03.720 --> 21:05.200
Maybe Mom will come back tomorrow!

463
21:05.200 --> 21:05.510
Enough.

464
21:05.510 --> 21:06.960
Stop yelling, okay?

465
21:11.160 --> 21:12.760
Look at the temperature now.

466
21:12.830 --> 21:14.400
It's hard to find the body

467
21:14.400 --> 21:17.060
if anyone jumps into an ice hole in this weather.

468
21:17.830 --> 21:19.690
Let's try to use our connections.

469
21:21.510 --> 21:22.570
But no matter what,

470
21:22.920 --> 21:25.050
I have to go back to Shenzhen on Friday.

471
21:29.830 --> 21:30.890
Are you even human?

472
21:32.350 --> 21:33.400
Mom is missing right now,

473
21:33.400 --> 21:34.960
and you're just going to leave?

474
21:34.960 --> 21:35.480
Look,

475
21:35.480 --> 21:36.920
the weather forecast said

476
21:36.920 --> 21:38.790
it will snow in Fucheng on Saturday,

477
21:38.790 --> 21:40.550
so I have to leave on Friday.

478
21:46.400 --> 21:47.510
The patient is 65 years old.

479
21:47.510 --> 21:48.270
He was taking care of his grandson at home.

480
21:48.270 --> 21:49.160
While eating pistachios,

481
21:49.160 --> 21:50.270
he found one that wasn't open.

482
21:50.270 --> 21:51.070
He tried to crack it open with his teeth,

483
21:51.070 --> 21:52.200
but it went into his airway.

484
21:52.200 --> 21:53.070
But fortunately, his trachea

485
21:53.070 --> 21:54.000
is not completely blocked.

486
21:53.650 --> 21:54.910
[Zone C]

487
21:54.000 --> 21:55.030
He came to the hospital on his own.

488
21:55.030 --> 21:56.200
How long has the foreign object been in the airway?

489
21:56.200 --> 21:57.260
About ten minutes.

490
21:57.350 --> 21:58.480
No, I still can't get it out.

491
21:58.480 --> 21:59.720
The shell is too slippery.

492
21:59.720 --> 22:00.680
Have you tried the Heimlich maneuver?

493
22:00.680 --> 22:01.440
I tried, but it didn't work.

494
22:01.440 --> 22:01.960
Try again.

495
22:01.960 --> 22:02.310
Okay.

496
22:03.480 --> 22:03.960
Come on.

497
22:06.480 --> 22:07.080
Slow down.

498
22:17.750 --> 22:19.200
Spit, spit, spit it out!

499
22:20.090 --> 22:22.380
[Zone E]

500
22:22.580 --> 22:25.320
[Zone E]

501
22:33.030 --> 22:33.750
No need.

502
22:45.160 --> 22:46.490
It's still not working.

503
22:48.000 --> 22:49.000
We've tried inserting the bronchoscope

504
22:49.000 --> 22:50.310
several times already.

505
22:50.310 --> 22:51.640
The trachea is a bit swollen.

506
22:51.640 --> 22:52.310
Get him admitted.

507
22:52.310 --> 22:52.680
Put him under general anesthesia.

508
22:52.680 --> 22:53.920
Use a laryngoscope and a bronchoscope

509
22:53.920 --> 22:55.380
and see if we can remove it.

510
23:00.110 --> 23:00.750
Wait.

511
23:02.960 --> 23:04.690
It's too slippery to get a grip.

512
23:05.160 --> 23:06.240
If it really doesn't work,

513
23:06.240 --> 23:07.970
we'll have to do a tracheotomy.

514
23:12.240 --> 23:13.920
Sit here and wait for me for a while.

515
23:13.920 --> 23:15.250
Hey, what are you doing?

516
23:19.000 --> 23:19.530
Careful.

517
23:21.270 --> 23:22.200
Hold on, hold on.

518
23:22.790 --> 23:23.250
Well...

519
23:23.350 --> 23:24.640
Sir, the pistachio you ate

520
23:24.640 --> 23:25.350
is solid.

521
23:25.350 --> 23:26.480
Its surface is very smooth.

522
23:26.480 --> 23:27.550
If we use forceps, it'll just...

523
23:27.550 --> 23:28.590
Do you have a silicone gel sheeting?

524
23:28.590 --> 23:29.240
Sir, you can't go in there.

525
23:29.240 --> 23:30.350
I'll go ask and see if I can...

526
23:30.350 --> 23:32.350
Do you have a silicone gel sheeting?

527
23:32.590 --> 23:33.070
Wait.

528
23:33.790 --> 23:34.590
He's a doctor.

529
23:35.480 --> 23:36.680
Do you have any ideas?

530
23:37.160 --> 23:38.920
Do you have a silicone gel sheeting, surgical sutures

531
23:38.920 --> 23:39.720
and an IV tube?

532
23:39.920 --> 23:40.790
Wait here.

533
23:51.750 --> 23:53.480
Sir, let's get you some oxygen.

534
24:00.880 --> 24:01.880
The pistachio's surface

535
24:01.880 --> 24:03.000
is covered in mucus,

536
24:03.000 --> 24:04.350
so it's especially slippery.

537
24:04.350 --> 24:05.310
If you use forceps

538
24:05.310 --> 24:06.160
to extract it,

539
24:06.200 --> 24:07.160
it won't be easy.

540
24:07.400 --> 24:08.350
That's why every time

541
24:08.350 --> 24:09.550
you reach the glottis,

542
24:09.550 --> 24:10.680
it slips back down.

543
24:11.160 --> 24:12.240
It's the same principle as

544
24:12.240 --> 24:14.000
one of those claw machines.

545
24:14.000 --> 24:15.460
You can never grab the toy.

546
24:15.830 --> 24:16.270
In this situation,

547
24:16.270 --> 24:18.000
you need to think differently.

548
24:19.070 --> 24:20.070
Make a net

549
24:21.200 --> 24:22.830
and slide it underneath

550
24:23.030 --> 24:24.360
to catch the pistachio.

551
24:35.880 --> 24:36.750
Later, give the patient

552
24:36.750 --> 24:37.810
local anesthesia,

553
24:37.920 --> 24:38.790
and then insert

554
24:38.790 --> 24:39.550
this net.

555
24:39.680 --> 24:40.720
Theoretically,

556
24:40.720 --> 24:41.750
it will support the pistachio

557
24:41.750 --> 24:42.880
from underneath,

558
24:43.200 --> 24:44.160
then you can

559
24:44.350 --> 24:45.550
pull it out like this.

560
24:45.960 --> 24:46.490
Go ahead.

561
24:48.310 --> 24:48.830
Come on.

562
24:50.110 --> 24:50.840
Will it work?

563
24:51.030 --> 24:51.630
Let's try.

564
24:51.920 --> 24:53.250
We don't have much time.

565
24:53.310 --> 24:54.840
I'll take responsibility.

566
24:55.880 --> 24:57.440
Open your mouth. Open your mouth.

567
24:57.440 --> 24:58.370
Open your mouth.

568
25:23.550 --> 25:24.280
We've got it.

569
25:26.160 --> 25:26.490
Here.

570
25:29.200 --> 25:30.270
Hang in there.

571
25:30.440 --> 25:31.920
Hang in there, sir.

572
25:32.750 --> 25:34.070
It's out. It's out.

573
25:40.240 --> 25:40.790
It's out.

574
25:40.790 --> 25:41.440
All right, all right.

575
25:41.440 --> 25:42.000
It's out.

576
25:43.720 --> 25:44.680
You'll be fine.

577
25:53.070 --> 25:53.930
You'll be fine.

578
25:54.920 --> 25:55.720
It's alright.

579
26:18.550 --> 26:19.950
What are you laughing at?

580
26:20.270 --> 26:21.270
I'm not laughing.

581
26:21.310 --> 26:22.310
Mom's in big trouble now,

582
26:22.310 --> 26:23.680
and you're in the mood to laugh?

583
26:23.680 --> 26:24.830
You heard wrong. I wasn't laughing.

584
26:24.830 --> 26:26.290
My nose is uncomfortable.

585
26:27.440 --> 26:28.200
Your nose is uncomfortable?

586
26:28.200 --> 26:30.400
Why don't you just stop breathing then?

587
26:33.240 --> 26:33.840
Slow down.

588
26:34.270 --> 26:35.000
Take it slow.

589
26:37.920 --> 26:39.180
Come on, get in the car.

590
26:54.050 --> 26:58.660
[Title] [Youyi Road, Jinxiu District, Fucheng City, Fu'an Province]

591
27:11.320 --> 27:12.970
[Intersection of Youyi Road and Ping'an Street]

592
27:20.680 --> 27:23.030
[Beidou Lane-Level Navigation]

593
27:23.200 --> 27:23.920
Turn right.

594
27:28.200 --> 27:29.160
Turn right.

595
27:29.350 --> 27:31.310
Don't you know there's traffic at the intersection?

596
27:31.310 --> 27:32.480
The GPS told me to go straight.

597
27:32.480 --> 27:33.070
I told you to turn,

598
27:33.070 --> 27:34.640
so just turn, okay?

599
27:34.960 --> 27:36.680
What's with that stupid GPS?

600
27:36.920 --> 27:37.880
You've been in Shenzhen for a few years,

601
27:37.880 --> 27:38.720
and you've already forgotten who you are.

602
27:38.720 --> 27:39.240
right?

603
27:39.920 --> 27:41.270
Do you still remember your name?

604
27:41.270 --> 27:42.110
Save your scolding for later.

605
27:42.110 --> 27:43.440
I need to take this call.

606
27:47.510 --> 27:48.110
Hello.

607
27:49.680 --> 27:51.310
Hello, is this Dr. Liu?

608
27:52.400 --> 27:52.920
Yes.

609
27:53.240 --> 27:55.240
I went to the hospital for a checkup.

610
27:55.400 --> 27:56.660
What were the results?

611
27:56.750 --> 27:58.480
The doctor said it's a pituitary tumor.

612
27:58.480 --> 28:00.410
Fortunately, it was found in time.

613
28:00.590 --> 28:03.310
I've been admitted to the hospital, and I'm preparing for surgery.

614
28:03.310 --> 28:04.680
Thank you so much.

615
28:05.480 --> 28:07.210
I topped up your phone balance.

616
28:07.680 --> 28:09.160
I won't keep you any longer.

617
28:09.160 --> 28:10.070
Thank you. Thank you.

618
28:10.070 --> 28:10.930
Okay, bye-bye.

619
28:17.440 --> 28:19.040
What are you laughing at now?

620
28:20.790 --> 28:22.520
What's wrong with me laughing?

621
28:22.750 --> 28:24.350
Everything is wrong with it.

622
28:25.400 --> 28:26.440
Our mom's missing,

623
28:26.440 --> 28:28.300
but you don't seem worried at all.

624
28:28.750 --> 28:29.880
The second someone mentions going back to Shenzhen,

625
28:29.880 --> 28:31.400
you're ready to fly away.

626
28:32.200 --> 28:33.530
Do you even have a heart?

627
28:34.750 --> 28:35.680
Were you just hoping

628
28:35.680 --> 28:36.880
Mom would die sooner,

629
28:36.920 --> 28:37.720
so no one would

630
28:37.720 --> 28:38.880
be a burden to you anymore, right?

631
28:38.880 --> 28:39.920
At the ER,

632
28:40.110 --> 28:41.240
just because of a few words from me,

633
28:41.240 --> 28:42.440
I saved an old man from the pain

634
28:42.440 --> 28:44.240
of having his trachea cut open.

635
28:44.790 --> 28:45.790
And just now,

636
28:46.000 --> 28:47.070
I learned that a patient

637
28:47.070 --> 28:47.750
got a second chance at life

638
28:47.750 --> 28:49.350
because of something I said.

639
28:49.400 --> 28:50.550
What's wrong with being happy about that?

640
28:50.550 --> 28:51.350
There is something wrong with it.

641
28:51.350 --> 28:52.160
If you cared

642
28:52.160 --> 28:53.110
about Mom even a little bit,

643
28:53.110 --> 28:54.770
you couldn't possibly laugh.

644
28:56.160 --> 28:57.720
You've been in Shenzhen for so many years.

645
28:57.720 --> 28:58.960
Whenever Mom talks about you, she cries.

646
28:58.960 --> 29:00.030
Whenever she mentions you, she cries.

647
29:00.030 --> 29:01.230
Has she ever laughed?

648
29:02.750 --> 29:04.310
Maybe I'm not as successful as you,

649
29:04.310 --> 29:05.310
but I can be there for Mom,

650
29:05.310 --> 29:06.310
have a few more meals with her,

651
29:06.310 --> 29:07.200
help her buy groceries,

652
29:07.200 --> 29:08.310
and carry them upstairs for her.

653
29:08.310 --> 29:09.200
Where are you?

654
29:09.200 --> 29:10.960
I'm a better son than you are.

655
29:21.400 --> 29:22.000
Ah-Guang.

656
29:22.000 --> 29:23.310
Don't "Ah-Guang" me.

657
29:23.720 --> 29:24.480
Where are you from anyway?

658
29:24.480 --> 29:25.720
What's with the "Ah"?

659
29:26.000 --> 29:27.600
Just call me Liu Zhengguang.

660
29:31.590 --> 29:32.320
Stop the car.

661
29:34.070 --> 29:35.200
We're not there yet.

662
29:36.070 --> 29:37.030
Stop the car.

663
29:39.550 --> 29:40.160
Stop the car!

664
29:40.160 --> 29:41.240
Pull over ahead. Pull over!

665
29:41.240 --> 29:42.240
Fine, fine, fine.

666
29:52.920 --> 29:53.750
Liu Zhengguang,

667
29:53.750 --> 29:54.960
you're already in your twenties.

668
29:54.960 --> 29:56.560
Don't act like a child, okay?

669
29:56.590 --> 29:57.550
I can't hear you.

670
29:57.640 --> 29:58.790
Don't tell me what to do.

671
29:58.790 --> 29:59.720
I don't know you.

672
30:07.590 --> 30:08.680
Go back by yourself.

673
30:08.680 --> 30:09.540
Leave me alone.

674
30:12.000 --> 30:13.270
I don't have the key.

675
30:18.720 --> 30:20.050
Now you've got it, okay?

676
30:24.000 --> 30:26.260
I told you to leave, and you actually did?

677
30:26.310 --> 30:28.110
You won't even spoil me a little?

678
30:56.000 --> 30:57.330
Who are you looking for?

679
30:58.400 --> 30:59.790
I'm looking for Liu Zhengguang.

680
30:59.790 --> 31:01.190
I have something for him.

681
31:01.400 --> 31:02.110
Give it to me.

682
31:02.110 --> 31:03.040
I'm his brother.

683
31:07.160 --> 31:10.030
This is your mother's last letter.

684
31:10.790 --> 31:12.310
It has been authenticated.

685
31:12.310 --> 31:14.400
It's indeed in your mother's handwriting.

686
31:14.400 --> 31:15.920
Zhengguang and I are friends.

687
31:15.920 --> 31:18.780
He reported her missing and brought this letter in.

688
31:22.270 --> 31:23.720
They still haven't found her.

689
31:23.720 --> 31:24.920
Don't give up hope.

690
31:28.440 --> 31:29.700
What's wrong with him?

691
31:30.160 --> 31:31.760
He didn't even say thank you.

692
31:32.030 --> 31:33.760
And he came back from a big city?

693
32:10.680 --> 32:12.140
Zhengliang, Zhengguang.

694
32:13.750 --> 32:16.280
I've been waiting for this day for a long time.

695
32:19.160 --> 32:20.960
Ever since your father passed away,

696
32:20.960 --> 32:23.480
I've felt that life was meaningless.

697
32:25.200 --> 32:26.200
All these years,

698
32:26.270 --> 32:27.160
if it weren't for

699
32:27.160 --> 32:29.240
raising you two little kids,

700
32:29.680 --> 32:32.200
I might have followed him long ago.

701
32:33.960 --> 32:36.310
I knitted a scarf for each of you.

702
32:36.830 --> 32:39.030
The bankbook is in the big medicine box.

703
32:39.070 --> 32:40.800
Split it between the two of you.

704
32:41.000 --> 32:42.660
The house goes to Zhengguang.

705
32:43.440 --> 32:44.880
Our place is spacious,

706
32:45.200 --> 32:47.270
but there's a crematorium across the street,

707
32:47.270 --> 32:48.670
so it won't sell for much.

708
32:49.720 --> 32:50.450
Zhengguang,

709
32:50.920 --> 32:52.550
you should give your brother a little extra too,

710
32:52.550 --> 32:53.590
just as a gesture.

711
32:53.960 --> 32:56.490
Don't fight over such a small amount of money.

712
32:57.480 --> 32:59.140
Back then, I bought this place

713
32:59.550 --> 33:00.960
just so I could watch the smoke

714
33:00.960 --> 33:03.830
rising from the crematorium when I had nothing else to do.

715
33:03.830 --> 33:05.200
I always felt I could see

716
33:05.200 --> 33:07.130
your father's shadow in the smoke.

717
33:07.640 --> 33:09.880
Others buy houses with ocean views,

718
33:10.680 --> 33:13.610
I bought a house with a view of the crematorium smoke.

719
33:15.550 --> 33:16.590
I know you two brothers

720
33:16.590 --> 33:18.190
each have your own troubles,

721
33:18.880 --> 33:20.610
but who doesn't have problems?

722
33:21.350 --> 33:22.720
I may be old,

723
33:23.510 --> 33:24.920
but I'm not experienced.

724
33:25.200 --> 33:26.730
I don't have any solutions.

725
33:27.000 --> 33:29.130
You'll have to work it out yourselves.

726
33:31.400 --> 33:32.400
After I'm gone,

727
33:33.750 --> 33:35.240
if you find my body,

728
33:35.680 --> 33:37.340
just keep the funeral simple.

729
33:38.480 --> 33:40.480
If you can't find it, then forget it.

730
33:40.750 --> 33:42.070
It'll save some money

731
33:42.400 --> 33:44.460
for you two bachelors to get married.

732
33:46.640 --> 33:48.240
If you need me in the future,

733
33:49.160 --> 33:50.960
just burn some paper offerings.

734
33:51.000 --> 33:52.030
Your father and I

735
33:52.350 --> 33:54.150
will watch over you from heaven.

736
34:27.320 --> 34:27.960
Son.

737
34:28.360 --> 34:29.230
Let me tell you,

738
34:29.440 --> 34:30.320
today,

739
34:30.630 --> 34:32.070
you're staying in this room.

740
34:32.070 --> 34:34.130
You are not allowed to go out, hear me?

741
34:35.000 --> 34:35.510
Also,

742
34:36.480 --> 34:38.540
when you get home, don't tell your mom

743
34:38.670 --> 34:39.840
that I took you winter swimming,

744
34:39.840 --> 34:40.400
got it?

745
34:42.920 --> 34:43.590
Later,

746
34:43.590 --> 34:44.880
I'll buy you some candy.

747
34:44.880 --> 34:45.440
Okay.

748
34:45.670 --> 34:46.280
Liu.

749
34:47.000 --> 34:48.760
Let's split into two teams today

750
34:48.760 --> 34:49.760
and have a relay race.

751
34:49.760 --> 34:52.150
Let's see who can hold their breath underwater the longest.

752
34:52.150 --> 34:53.190
I'm telling you.

753
34:53.190 --> 34:54.449
I'm bored of that game.

754
34:55.480 --> 34:57.280
Then you come up with something.

755
34:58.590 --> 34:59.450
How about this?

756
35:00.360 --> 35:01.620
I'll dive from this end

757
35:01.800 --> 35:02.920
all the way

758
35:02.920 --> 35:03.880
to your side.

759
35:04.710 --> 35:05.590
If you can swim across,

760
35:05.590 --> 35:07.360
-I'll cover half of the fine for having a second child for you. -Be my witness.

761
35:07.360 --> 35:08.560
I'll be your witness.

762
35:20.840 --> 35:22.070
Liu.

763
35:22.710 --> 35:23.840
Liu!

764
36:05.920 --> 36:07.230
Liu, swim this way.

765
36:07.280 --> 36:09.960
Liu! Liu!

766
36:10.550 --> 36:12.070
Liu!

767
36:12.360 --> 36:13.710
This way.

768
36:35.710 --> 36:37.360
Dad!

769
37:11.840 --> 37:13.500
Ever since the day my dad died,

770
37:13.920 --> 37:15.590
I became afraid of snow.

771
37:16.670 --> 37:19.800
Whether it's falling from the sky or lying on the ground,

772
37:20.150 --> 37:21.190
as long as I see it,

773
37:22.150 --> 37:24.210
an overwhelming terror comes over me

774
37:24.960 --> 37:26.760
and pulls me back to that moment.

775
37:41.670 --> 37:43.330
Is there nothing around here?

776
37:43.360 --> 37:44.070
No.

777
37:44.110 --> 37:45.630
Let's search farther ahead.

778
37:45.630 --> 37:47.630
Come on, let's check farther ahead.

779
38:01.230 --> 38:02.830
Liu, help me take off my gear.

780
38:03.360 --> 38:03.840
Okay.

781
38:03.840 --> 38:05.110
Thank you. Thank you.

782
38:06.920 --> 38:08.400
We've been freezing out here all day,

783
38:08.400 --> 38:09.920
and there's still no sign of her.

784
38:09.920 --> 38:11.380
Let's call it a day for now.

785
38:11.840 --> 38:12.400
Okay.

786
38:13.400 --> 38:14.190
Thanks, man.

787
38:15.190 --> 38:17.110
Don't get too anxious.

788
38:17.960 --> 38:20.110
No news may be good news.

789
38:20.630 --> 38:21.360
Understand?

790
38:21.710 --> 38:22.070
Alright,

791
38:22.070 --> 38:23.270
I'll go let them know.

792
38:39.280 --> 38:40.340
This way. This way.

793
38:44.230 --> 38:46.070
According to the test results,

794
38:46.070 --> 38:46.730
the patient

795
38:47.150 --> 38:49.320
has a vascular malformation

796
38:49.320 --> 38:51.000
with associated bleeding as well.

797
38:51.000 --> 38:52.400
This requires surgery

798
38:52.400 --> 38:53.710
to remove it.

799
38:54.320 --> 38:55.360
Is it that serious?

800
38:55.360 --> 38:56.070
We'll do it.

801
38:56.190 --> 38:57.320
We'll pay whatever it costs,

802
38:57.320 --> 38:57.840
doctor.

803
38:57.840 --> 38:59.960
But there's a bit of a problem now.

804
38:59.960 --> 39:00.920
What problem?

805
39:00.920 --> 39:02.630
Where are my friend's scans? Can you show me?

806
39:02.630 --> 39:03.280
The scans are out.

807
39:03.280 --> 39:04.150
Wait a minute.

808
39:04.150 --> 39:06.150
We're in the middle of a consultation.

809
39:06.150 --> 39:06.960
Could you step outside first?

810
39:06.960 --> 39:08.220
Go out and wait in line.

811
39:08.400 --> 39:09.070
-Hold on. -Go ahead, doctor.

812
39:09.070 --> 39:10.000
Sorry.

813
39:10.400 --> 39:11.400
I'm in a bit of a hurry here.

814
39:11.400 --> 39:11.760
Please wait a moment.

815
39:11.760 --> 39:12.890
Who isn't in a hurry?

816
39:13.320 --> 39:14.920
Can't you see we're talking?

817
39:14.920 --> 39:16.230
You interrupted us halfway through.

818
39:16.230 --> 39:17.510
The vascular malformation and the problem?

819
39:17.510 --> 39:18.190
I forgot what you just said

820
39:18.190 --> 39:18.840
because they...

821
39:18.840 --> 39:20.000
they interrupted me.

822
39:20.000 --> 39:20.710
Get... get out.

823
39:20.710 --> 39:21.110
You're just causing trouble.

824
39:21.110 --> 39:21.480
Don't push me.

825
39:21.480 --> 39:22.550
-Wait. Wait. -Will you be held responsible if this gets delayed?

826
39:22.550 --> 39:23.480
Hey, don't push me.

827
39:23.480 --> 39:24.480
I'm a doctor here.

828
39:24.480 --> 39:25.400
I'm a doctor, okay?

829
39:25.400 --> 39:27.510
Even the hospital president has to wait in line, understand?

830
39:27.510 --> 39:28.190
Cutting in line?

831
39:28.190 --> 39:29.070
What are you doing?

832
39:29.070 --> 39:29.800
Keep your hands to yourself.

833
39:29.800 --> 39:30.960
We came from the ER.

834
39:30.960 --> 39:32.230
So did my brother.

835
39:32.550 --> 39:33.360
Can't you understand or what?

836
39:33.360 --> 39:34.000
Did you rent that mouth or what?

837
39:34.000 --> 39:34.670
Why are you in such a hurry?

838
39:34.670 --> 39:36.400
-You three are here for the same patient! -I don't know them.

839
39:36.080 --> 39:40.590
[Authorized Personnel Only; One Patient, One Visitor]

840
39:36.400 --> 39:37.280
I really don't know them.

841
39:37.280 --> 39:38.000
We're not here for the same patient.

842
39:38.000 --> 39:38.630
Pull up the scans.

843
39:38.630 --> 39:39.230
Don't bother arguing with her.

844
39:39.230 --> 39:39.590
Hurry.

845
39:39.590 --> 39:40.360
If you squeeze in any farther...

846
39:40.360 --> 39:41.230
-Keep pushing, huh? -Why are you dragging me?

847
39:41.230 --> 39:42.070
You still want to squeeze through?

848
39:42.070 --> 39:42.840
Here.

849
39:43.020 --> 39:44.630
[Authorized Personnel Only; One Patient, One Visitor]

850
39:43.550 --> 39:45.230
Push me again and see what happens.

851
39:45.230 --> 39:45.760
Hey,

852
39:46.230 --> 39:47.150
these are my brother's scans.

853
39:47.150 --> 39:47.800
Step outside first!

854
39:47.800 --> 39:48.550
These are his brother's scans.

855
39:48.550 --> 39:49.190
My brother's!

856
39:49.190 --> 39:50.030
His brother's!

857
39:50.030 --> 39:51.760
My brother's. Don't you get it?

858
39:52.840 --> 39:53.480
You three

859
39:53.480 --> 39:55.150
are here for the same patient!

860
39:55.280 --> 39:56.400
I... I've been telling you that all along!

861
39:56.400 --> 39:57.150
I said, you three are here for the same patient!

862
39:57.150 --> 39:57.840
Why are you

863
39:57.840 --> 39:58.970
making such a scene?

864
40:15.550 --> 40:16.550
My name is Ai Chen.

865
40:19.510 --> 40:20.320
I'm sorry.

866
40:20.320 --> 40:20.800
I didn't know

867
40:20.800 --> 40:22.400
you were Zhengguang's boss.

868
40:23.630 --> 40:24.710
Why didn't you tell me earlier

869
40:24.710 --> 40:26.800
that you were Zhengguang's older brother?

870
40:26.800 --> 40:28.230
I'm not his older brother.

871
40:28.230 --> 40:29.030
He is.

872
40:33.920 --> 40:34.840
How is it?

873
40:35.920 --> 40:37.920
The vascular malformation is large

874
40:38.110 --> 40:39.840
and there's associated bleeding.

875
40:39.840 --> 40:41.100
He needs a craniotomy.

876
40:41.960 --> 40:42.920
The key is

877
40:42.920 --> 40:44.550
the location of the lesion.

878
40:44.880 --> 40:46.030
The lesion is located

879
40:46.030 --> 40:48.510
adjacent to the posterior part of the left inferior frontal gyrus,

880
40:48.510 --> 40:49.840
which is closely related

881
40:49.840 --> 40:51.370
to the motor speech center.

882
40:52.710 --> 40:54.880
If anything goes wrong during surgery,

883
40:54.880 --> 40:55.960
the patient could

884
40:55.960 --> 40:57.420
lose the ability to speak.

885
40:57.670 --> 40:59.470
This surgery is very difficult.

886
41:00.070 --> 41:02.190
No one in Fucheng can do it.

887
41:03.230 --> 41:04.480
You should go to Beijing

888
41:04.480 --> 41:06.630
and find him a hospital there as soon as possible.

889
41:06.630 --> 41:08.760
But the patient's current condition

890
41:08.760 --> 41:09.800
is very unstable.

891
41:10.110 --> 41:11.640
If the bleeding continues,

892
41:12.710 --> 41:14.440
his life could be in danger.

893
41:15.710 --> 41:17.840
You family members should

894
41:17.840 --> 41:20.700
quickly discuss your options and decide what to do.

895
41:21.480 --> 41:22.320
I'll do it.

896
41:24.400 --> 41:24.920
I mean,

897
41:25.320 --> 41:26.030
are you sure about

898
41:26.030 --> 41:27.360
this craniotomy thing?

899
41:27.360 --> 41:28.550
If not, let's just go to Beijing,

900
41:28.550 --> 41:29.110
okay?

901
41:29.110 --> 41:31.480
Beijing is far away, and the risk is greater for him.

902
41:31.480 --> 41:32.190
Then what should we do?

903
41:32.190 --> 41:34.050
You've been working in Shenzhen.

904
41:34.360 --> 41:35.480
You don't know anyone here.

905
41:35.480 --> 41:36.360
You said you want to do the surgery,

906
41:36.360 --> 41:37.150
but how

907
41:37.230 --> 41:39.030
can you coordinate everything?

908
41:39.030 --> 41:39.920
The biggest problem

909
41:39.920 --> 41:40.880
is where I'm licensed to do the surgery.

910
41:40.880 --> 41:42.480
What do you mean by that?

911
41:43.440 --> 41:45.630
It means doctors can only perform surgery

912
41:45.630 --> 41:48.030
at the hospital where they're registered.

913
41:48.190 --> 41:49.070
Well, then...

914
41:50.320 --> 41:51.000
How about

915
41:51.000 --> 41:52.150
you apply to the hospital

916
41:52.150 --> 41:54.350
for an out-of-hospital consultation?

917
41:54.590 --> 41:55.920
That won't work either.

918
41:56.000 --> 41:56.960
He got fired.

919
41:59.760 --> 42:00.760
Fired?

920
42:03.110 --> 42:05.000
You got fired?

921
42:08.070 --> 42:11.200
Did they fire you because you weren't competent enough?

922
42:12.800 --> 42:14.230
I might not be the best doctor

923
42:14.230 --> 42:15.150
in the country,

924
42:15.150 --> 42:16.070
in this specialty,

925
42:16.070 --> 42:16.760
or in this age group...

926
42:16.760 --> 42:18.090
Then what is your point?

927
42:19.510 --> 42:20.400
But among my peers,

928
42:20.400 --> 42:21.600
I'd rank in the top 20.

929
42:22.070 --> 42:22.710
My goodness.

930
42:22.710 --> 42:23.800
After everything you said,

931
42:23.800 --> 42:25.360
you only ranked in the top 20?

932
42:25.360 --> 42:26.550
And you're using your age group as an excuse?

933
42:26.550 --> 42:27.400
Do you know how many great neurosurgeons

934
42:27.400 --> 42:28.710
there are in the country?

935
42:28.710 --> 42:30.070
Why would I need to know that?

936
42:30.070 --> 42:30.840
Do you know who ranks in the top 20

937
42:30.840 --> 42:31.760
at playing the suona?

938
42:31.760 --> 42:33.070
-Do you know that? -Alright, alright.

939
42:33.070 --> 42:35.150
Don't get off topic.

940
42:35.630 --> 42:37.760
Zhengguang is lying in a hospital bed.

941
42:37.760 --> 42:38.590
And

942
42:38.590 --> 42:40.710
a craniotomy is a major operation.

943
42:40.880 --> 42:42.340
You are his older brother.

944
42:44.070 --> 42:45.400
Can you handle that kind of pressure?

945
42:45.400 --> 42:46.880
Why would I feel pressured?

946
42:46.880 --> 42:48.280
To me, every patient is just a patient.

947
42:48.280 --> 42:48.760
Besides,

948
42:48.760 --> 42:50.760
Zhengguang and I aren't that close.

949
42:51.510 --> 42:52.550
Zhengguang said

950
42:52.550 --> 42:54.410
his brother is cold and arrogant.

951
42:55.030 --> 42:56.030
Let me tell you,

952
42:56.360 --> 42:57.000
when it really counts,

953
42:57.000 --> 42:57.630
don't mess it up,

954
42:57.630 --> 42:58.290
you hear me?

955
43:01.030 --> 43:02.760
Are you really sure about this?

956
43:03.840 --> 43:05.100
I'm his older brother.

957
43:08.000 --> 43:10.530
I'll take care of the licensing issue for you.

958
43:11.510 --> 43:12.190
How?
